OL,3,AAI giant Anthropic valued at up to
OL,4,A$1.5tn ahead of stock market debut
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnthropic has seen its value jump to as
OL,7,Fmuch as $1.5tn (#1.14tn) as its shares
OL,8,Fare set to start trading on the stock
OL,9,Fmarket on Thursday.
OL,11,FThe artificial intelligence (AI)
OL,12,Fcompany behind the popular chatbot
OL,13,FClaude said its shares will be priced
OL,14,Fat $83 each when it lists on the
OL,15,FNasdaq, a tech-focused stock exchange
OL,16,Fbased in New York.
OL,18,FThat will make it one of the most
OL,19,Fvaluable companies in the world.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
