OL,3,AAI giant Anthropic valued at up to
OL,4,A$1.5tn ahead of stock market debut
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnthropic's stock market debut will
OL,7,Fmake it the first US firm focused
OL,8,Fexclusively on AI to go public. It will
OL,9,Falso mark a crucial test for the
OL,10,Ffast-growing industry, which faces
OL,11,Fquestions over whether the huge amounts
OL,12,Fof money being poured into the
OL,13,Ftechnology will be profitable.
